@host = http://localhost:5125

### ==============================================================================
### SITE RECEPTION AND VERIFICATION (BC-07) - EventStorming Execution Flow
### Actor: Site Resident (Residente de Obra)
### ==============================================================================

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### PATH A: COMPLETE SUCCESS & CONFORMITY LIFECYCLE
### Flow: Record Arrival -> Confirm Receipt -> Verify Material -> Registrar Conformidad
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Record Unit Arrival (Command: Record unit arrival -> Event: Arrival of the registered unit)
### Creates a new reception record when the transport unit arrives at the site gate.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/receptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dispatchId": "DSP-8001",
  "carrierPlate": "V3B-920",
  "driverName": "Carlos Mendoza",
  "siteId": 1,
  "siteName": "Obra Torres del Sol - Torre B",
  "siteResidentName": "Ing. Valeria Rivas",
  "items": [
    {
      "materialId": "MAT-CEM-01",
      "materialName": "Cemento Portland Tipo I (Bolsa 42.5kg)",
      "unit": "BOL",
      "dispatchedQuantity": 500
    },
    {
      "materialId": "MAT-VAR-12",
      "materialName": "Varilla de Acero Corrugado 1/2 pulgada",
      "unit": "UND",
      "dispatchedQuantity": 200
    }
  ]
}

### 2. View Registered Arrivals Board (Cross-check against recorded arrival / Tablero en obra)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/upcoming-arrivals

### 3. Confirm Receipt (Command: Confirm Receipt -> Event: Receipt confirmed)
### Records weighbridge scale weights, custody checklist, and resident digital signature.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/1/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryNoteNumber": "GR-2026-004521",
  "grossWeightKg": 28450.0,
  "tareWeightKg": 7200.0,
  "weighingSlipNumber": "BAL-LIMA-9821",
  "isSealIntact": true,
  "isDeliveryNotePhysicalOk": true,
  "isScaleCalibrated": true,
  "checklistRemarks": "Precinto de seguridad N° S-99214 intacto y sin signos de manipulación.",
  "signatureData": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzAiPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0xMCAxNSBRIDUwIDUgOTAgMTUiIHN0cm9rZT0iYmxhY2siIGZpbGw9InRyYW5zcGFyZW50Ii8+PC9zdmc+",
  "signedBy": "Ing. Valeria Rivas - Residente de Obra CIP 184920",
  "receiverNotes": "Unidad arriba en tiempo programado. Guía física conforme."
}

### 4. Verify Received Material (Command: Verify received material -> Event: Verified material)
### Step 4a: Verify Cement line item (exact quantity matching dispatch)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/1/verify-material
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materialId": "MAT-CEM-01",
  "receivedQuantity": 500.0,
  "comments": "Conteo físico al 100%: 500 bolsas en buen estado, sin roturas ni humedad."
}

### Step 4b: Verify Steel Rebar line item (exact quantity matching dispatch)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/1/verify-material
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materialId": "MAT-VAR-12",
  "receivedQuantity": 200.0,
  "comments": "200 varillas verificadas por atados de obra. Calibre conforme."
}

### 5. Record Compliance (Command: Registrar conformidad -> Event: Compliance recorded -> Office closed)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/1/conformity
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "complianceNotes": "Recepción 100% conforme. Peso de balanza, precinto y cantidades físicas coinciden plenamente con la guía de remisión. Despacho liberado y custodia transferida a almacén de obra."
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### PATH B: DISCREPANCY & EVIDENCE FLOW
### Flow: Record Arrival -> Confirm (compromised seal) -> Verify Material (shortage) -> Report Discrepancy -> Attach Photographic Evidence
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6. Record Arrival for a second unit
POST {{host}}/api/v1/receptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dispatchId": "DSP-8002",
  "carrierPlate": "B9F-841",
  "driverName": "Jorge Alarcón",
  "siteId": 1,
  "siteName": "Obra Torres del Sol - Torre B",
  "siteResidentName": "Ing. Valeria Rivas",
  "items": [
    {
      "materialId": "MAT-CEM-01",
      "materialName": "Cemento Portland Tipo I (Bolsa 42.5kg)",
      "unit": "BOL",
      "dispatchedQuantity": 400
    }
  ]
}

### 7. Confirm Receipt noting seal irregularity and weight difference
POST {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/2/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryNoteNumber": "GR-2026-004522",
  "grossWeightKg": 21800.0,
  "tareWeightKg": 6900.0,
  "weighingSlipNumber": "BAL-LIMA-9825",
  "isSealIntact": false,
  "isDeliveryNotePhysicalOk": true,
  "isScaleCalibrated": true,
  "checklistRemarks": "ALERTA: Precinto de seguridad presenta rasgaduras y no coincide con el número de guía.",
  "signatureData": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0wIDAgTDEwMCAxMCIgc3Ryb2tlPSJyZWQiLz48L3N2Zz4=",
  "signedBy": "Ing. Valeria Rivas - Residente de Obra",
  "receiverNotes": "Se procede a apertura bajo observación por presunto precinto adulterado."
}

### 8. Verify Received Material detecting missing physical items (merma / faltante)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/2/verify-material
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materialId": "MAT-CEM-01",
  "receivedQuantity": 365.0,
  "comments": "Faltante físico de 35 bolsas respecto a las 400 despachadas. Bolsas rotas con merma en plataforma."
}

### 9. Report Discrepancy (Command: Report discrepancy -> Event: Reported discrepancy)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/2/discrepancy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "MISSING_AND_DAMAGED_MATERIAL",
  "description": "Faltante de 35 bolsas de cemento Portland y 12 bolsas humedecidas no aptas para vaciado estructural.",
  "severity": "Critical"
}

### 10. Attach Photographic Evidence (Command: Attach photographic evidence -> Event: Photographic evidence attached)
### Step 10a: Broken seal photo
POST {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/2/evidence
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "evidenceType": "BROKEN_SEAL_PHOTO",
  "fileUrl": "https://storage.vigia.pe/evidences/reception-2/broken-seal-gate.jpg",
  "description": "Foto en garita del precinto de seguridad fracturado y manipulado."
}

### Step 10b: Damaged material photo
POST {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/2/evidence
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "evidenceType": "DAMAGED_MATERIAL_PHOTO",
  "fileUrl": "https://storage.vigia.pe/evidences/reception-2/damaged-cement-bags.jpg",
  "description": "Bolsas de cemento rotas con pérdida de material sobre la tolva del camión."
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### RETRIEVAL QUERIES
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 11. List all receptions across all sites
GET {{host}}/api/v1/receptions

### 12. List receptions filtered by site ID
GET {{host}}/api/v1/receptions?siteId=1

### 13. Get single reception by ID
GET {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/1

### 14. Get single reception by dispatch ID
GET {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/by-dispatch/DSP-8001

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### INVARIANT & BUSINESS RULE VALIDATION SCENARIOS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 15. Attempt to record compliance when security seal is broken (Fails with 400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/2/conformity
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "complianceNotes": "Intento inválido de registrar conformidad con precinto roto."
}

### 16. Attempt to confirm receipt with gross weight less than tare weight (Fails with 400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/1/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryNoteNumber": "GR-FAIL",
  "grossWeightKg": 5000.0,
  "tareWeightKg": 8000.0,
  "weighingSlipNumber": "BAL-FAIL",
  "isSealIntact": true,
  "isDeliveryNotePhysicalOk": true,
  "isScaleCalibrated": true,
  "signatureData": "sig",
  "signedBy": "Ing. Fail"
}

### 17. Attempt to query a non-existent reception (Fails with 404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/receptions/9999
